// di76-tuk - by Dwight Ivany
// di76 with a TUKAN "GUI 1 White" interface built on the tk_gui_tools library.
// The audio code and the slider block are identical to di76.jsfx (same DSP,
// same slots 1,5,9,13,17,21 with "-reserved" spacers), so saved sessions and
// slider values are interchangeable between di76 and di76-tuk.
// GUI library: tk_gui_tools.jsfx-inc by Tukan_Studios - "free as in free
// beer", may be used, modified and shared for JSFX plugins; parts of the
// VU-meter code with friendly permission from ZenoMOD (chris-s, ZenoMOD).
//   https://stash.reaper.fm/v/53055/tk-gui-tools.zip
// The GUI 1 layout and white skin values are adapted from the "Blue One
// Compressor BL-1C" example (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2026 JClones / Tukan):
//   https://github.com/TukanStudios/TUKAN_STUDIOS_PLUGINS
// GUI 1 draws everything from code - no PNG image files are needed.
// DSP origin/credits: see di76.jsfx (Stillwell 1175, BSD, retained below).

